    "caption": "A polite maybe that is often a quiet no, and how to tell the difference.\n\n検討します (けんとうします) = we will consider it. Often a gentle way to decline, though sometimes it is real thinking.\n\nA real maybe comes with a date or a question: 検討して、金曜日までにお返事します。 = I will think it over and reply by Friday.\n\nNothing more after it? Ask: いつごろお返事をいただけますか。 = When can I hear back?\n\nSend this to your study partner.",
